227	<h2 id="agent-h">Each of the 8 Focus Areas Points to Code and a Span</h2>
228	<ol class="areas col">
229	<li><b>Planning</b><p>Claude turns the docs page into a runbook and copies each command exactly.</p><span class="pf"><a href="https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun/blob/main/src/firstrun/planner.py#L319">planner.py</a><span><code>planner</code> AGENT span</span></span></li>
230	<li><b>Tool use</b><p>Firecrawl reads the page, Docker runs each step, and Jev classifies a failure.</p><span class="pf"><a href="https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun/blob/main/src/firstrun/classify.py#L128">classify.py</a><span>one TOOL span per call</span></span></li>
231	<li><b>State</b><p><code>state.json</code> is written after every step, so <code>firstrun run --resume RUN_ID</code> picks up a stopped run.</p><span class="pf"><a href="https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun/blob/main/src/firstrun/state.py#L52">state.py</a></span></li>
232	<li><b>Context</b><p>The planner reads only the quickstart page.</p><span class="pf"><a href="https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun/blob/main/src/firstrun/planner.py#L140">planner.py</a><span><code>read_docs</code> TOOL span</span></span></li>
233	<li><b>Execution</b><p>One fresh container per run, with the exit code on every step.</p><span class="pf"><a href="https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun/blob/main/src/firstrun/executor.py#L87">executor.py</a><span><code>step.N</code> TOOL span</span></span></li>
234	<li><b>Recovery</b><p>Classify, search, patch and retry, at most 3 times per step.</p><span class="pf"><a href="https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun/blob/main/src/firstrun/recovery.py#L300">recovery.py</a><span><code>recover.N</code> AGENT span</span></span></li>
235	<li><b>Verification</b><p>A second clean container reruns the patched steps with model calls blocked.</p><span class="pf"><a href="https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun/blob/main/src/firstrun/verify.py#L57">verify.py</a><span><code>verify</code> GUARDRAIL span</span></span></li>
236	<li><b>Iteration</b><p>v1 traces, 2 neatlogs detections, a planner fix, then v2 traces on the same targets.</p><span class="pf"><a href="https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun/commit/3ca6f118ecb0a8915315eea27b5588dd8a7c6299">commit 3ca6f11</a><a href="#before-after">the table below</a></span></li>
237	</ol>
